npe8n4le02ob11re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "enpe8n4le02ob11re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<span class= \"strong\"> David</span>: I'm glad to see that your grasp on concepts is on point. Now, let's move on to customer relationship management. What do you know about it?<br>\n<span class= \"strong\"> Paul</span>: Well, I know it's an essential part of any business. The purpose is to know well your customers to provide the products, services and contact they need. Another important aspect is that we can use some software that is devoted entirely to this. It's called a CRM tool."}, {"time": "28000", "image": "enpe8n4le02ob11re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class= \"strong\"> David</span>: How did your previous company use to manage that information?<br>\n<span class= \"strong\"> Paul</span>: Well, they used to have a very complicated system before. It was a little unreliable as well, because it didn't keep track of all transactions, and we also experienced data loss sometimes. However, once they updated it, they divided the work on areas like sales, marketing and services. And each one of them outlined the most relevant information from the customers' profile, so we could interact with these categories to offer services or products based on their previous preferences and history."}, {"time": "67000", "image": "enpe8n4le02ob11re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class= \"strong\"> David</span>: Great. We have a cloud-based CRM software. Did your company have a similar one?<br>\n<span class= \"strong\"> Paul</span>: Well, they didn't use to store anything online until they updated the system. In fact, they used to keep physical files. The CRM system they got was also cloud-based, and made everything much easier.<br>\n<span class= \"strong\"> David</span>: Great to know! So, our system is quite robust. We not only use the information we collect to keep track of transactions, register interactions with customers, or offer new products. We want them to feel like we know them well, like a small shop owner would know his most loyal customers. Our goal is to retain the most loyal customers due to their profiles and, obviously, the benefits they obtain from our products.<br>\n<span class= \"strong\"> Paul</span>: Wow, I didn't know that."}], "coverimg": "enpe8n4le02ob11re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0}]}